# Ruta 12 (C5a, contract 47), 22 x 40. column = i, row = j. Pueblo Bruma's south gate arrives at the NORTH edge (i = 9..10, j = 0), Ruta 13 is the SOUTH edge (i = 9..10, j = 39).
# Look (the user's mock "Ruta 12"): a long WOODEN PIER over the open SEA (planks across, bollards, a net rack and lobster traps, sailboats and rocks in the water): the north half hugs the shore (grass, tall grass,
# trees on the west, the sea on the east), the south half crosses a bay (water on both sides, two lanes, then ONE lane). The FISHING GURU waits at the start of the pier (the Caña vieja, flag 830); three fishermen
# stand on the lanes (they look up the lane); the SLEEPING CREATURE (Slumberth L30) fills the single plank of the narrow stretch until the Flauta Clara wakes it.
# Wild: grass table, `water` (surfing, C5b) and the three fishing tables (the reed rod = Flopfin).
@map ruta_12
@size 22 40
@interior no
@area ruta_12
@flag cana_vieja_given 830     # the fishing guru gave the Caña vieja (script guru)
@bg 0
@fill grass
@spawn north 10 1 S
@spawn south 10 38 N
@encounters grass rate=20
  mossbud 27 29 30
  flitter 26 28 20
  shellfern 27 29 20
  flitwing 27 29 20
  mossbloom 27 29 10
@end
# Open ground (contract 63, normal route): a step onto plain ground (not tall grass, water, a door, a ledge, an arrow floor) rolls this table when rand8 < 4 (4/256 per step).
@open_rate 4
# Roaming wild creatures (contract 55, rollout in 63): 3 creatures of this table wander the open ground (not the tall grass); touching one starts that wild battle.
@roam 3 table=grass period=1800
@encounters water rate=15
  urchip 27 31 50
  skipgoby 27 31 20
  clubrimp 27 31 15
  flopfin 23 27 15
@end
@encounters fish_old
  flopfin 5 5 100
@end
@encounters fish_good
  flopfin 10 10 25
  skipgoby 10 10 30
  clubrimp 10 10 25
  lazatee 10 10 20
@end
@encounters fish_super
  clubrimp 15 20 30
  skipgoby 15 20 25
  lazatee 15 20 20
  urchip 15 20 15
  flopfin 15 20 10
@end
@legend
  .  tile=grass
  A  object=net_rack
  B  npc=mama id=npc_b face=N text=ruta12.npc.b
  C  object=flowerbed
  D  object=sign text=ruta12.sign interact=look
  E  object=trap
  F  object=bollard
